# Duplicate routes collapsed onto one canonical URL each. Every one of these
# shipped byte-identical page source (except /project, an older copy of the
# projects page), so each was a second indexable URL competing with the real
# one. Nothing in the site linked to them, but they may be bookmarked or
# indexed, so they redirect rather than 404.
#
# Workers static assets reads this from the assets directory; Next copies
# public/ into out/ on export.
